OL,3,AGreen Party members back 'Zionism is
OL,4,Aracism' motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen Party members have adopted a
OL,7,Fmotion declaring Zionism a form of
OL,8,Fracism, in a move that has divided
OL,9,Fsenior figures at the top of the party.
OL,11,FThe party's joint deputy leaders have
OL,12,Fbeen at odds over the subject, with
OL,13,FMothin Ali backing the move, and Rachel
OL,14,FMillward describing the wording as
OL,15,F"problematic".
OL,17,FActivists endorsed the policy motion,
OL,18,Fwhich was put forward by a group of
OL,19,Fmembers at the party's conference in
OL,20,FBrighton, by 1022 votes to 813.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
