OL,3,AGreen Party members back 'Zionism is
OL,4,Aracism' motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FDiscussion about the vote has dominated
OL,7,Fthe conference, and exposed divisions
OL,8,Fbetween the party's newly enlarged
OL,9,Fmembership base under leader Zack
OL,10,FPolanski and its MPs elected at the
OL,11,Flast election.
